  "instructions": [
    "Wash and rinse the callaloo leaves thoroughly.",
    "Heat sesame oil in a deep pot over medium heat and sauté onion, garlic, and ginger until fragrant.",
    "Add carrot and bell pepper slices, cooking for 3 minutes with frequent stirring.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth, soy sauce, fish sauce, and lime juice, then bring the mixture to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes until the callaloo leaves are tender and the flavors meld.",
    "Stir in red chili flakes and adjust seasoning with salt if necessary.",
    "Garnish with fresh coriander leaves and green onion before serving.",
    "Serve hot with a side of cauliflower rice for a complete diabetic-friendly meal."
